---
/**
 * An interviewer's question in the running text, followed by the answer as
 * ordinary paragraphs: <Question>Hvernig lítur sá nýi veruleiki út?</Question>
 * (For a self-contained Q&A in a box, use Interview.)
 */
---

<div class="question"><slot /></div>

<style>
  .question {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--cat-base);
    color: var(--cat-text);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .question :global(p) {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .question :global(p + p) {
    margin-top: 0.75em;
  }
</style>
